    "corrections": [
      "0316: paper crab has eight legs; folded blue shell, short tan trial and final green shell are visually distinct; placing hand reaches shell.",
      "0317: turtle has four limbs even when reaching; two-drawer young flashback holds leaf/nutshell, adult has 48 drawers; unloaded drawers are empty and two rejected packets remain ashore.",
      "0318: long silver fringe reaches faces before cutting, short remains after; repair umbrella scaled to reach hand; platform supports chairs and both readers, hands hold one shared book; flags on chair backs.",
      "0319: seated squirrel rests on stool; both hands reach the keyboard for playing, violin/bow and music stand retained by scene.",
      "0320: twelve bench legs attach to seat in two rows of six; seventh foot aligns with brick crack, freeing and raised supporting stones follow the text; seated children lowered onto seat."
    ],
    "limitations": "Simplified original geometric storybook scenes. Contact sheet inspection and selected fullsize visual inspection are recorded separately; this does not claim full audio listening or deployment."
